}\n\n        .btn-apply-with-linkedin {\n            color: white;\n            background-color: #2867B2;\n            border-color: #2867B2;\n        }\n\n        .btn-apply-with-linkedin:hover {\n            color: white;\n            background-color: #1e4c84;\n        }\n\n        .btn-apply-with-dropbox {\n            color: white;\n            background-color: #0062FF;\n            border-color: #0062FF;\n        }\n\n        .btn-apply-with-dropbox:hover {\n            color: white;\n            background-color: #004cc7;\n        }\n\n        .btn-apply-with-pitchyou {\n            color: white;\n            background-color: #075e54;\n            border-color: #075e54;\n        }\n\n        .btn-apply-with-pitchyou:hover, .btn-apply-with-pitchyou:focus {\n            color: white;\n            background-color: #128c7e;\n            border-color: #128c7e;\n        }\n\n        .icon-bottom-padding {\n            padding-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n        </style>\n    \n\n    \n\n</head>\n\n<body id=\"portalBackground\" class=\"\" ng-csp=\"\">\n    \n    \n<!-- Fixed navbar -->\n<div class=\"navbar navbar-default navbar-fixed-top\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"navbar-header\">\n            \n                <a href=\"https://www.msg.group/de/karriere\" class=\"navbar-brand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                    \n                    <img alt=\"Logo\"\n                         id=\"portalLogo\"\n                         src=\"https://jobs.msg.group/appo/public/images/layout/26d9b04f-052f-4f1e-9dad-a63a760c799f/LOGO/DAGZmOrELyzgN2FSfNfg6PLYDTrsyQuEFDyQPIGRNhA.svg\">\n                </a>\n            \n\n            \n                <div id=\"portalName\" class=\"navbar-text\"></div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n    \n    \n\n    \n        <img alt=\"\" id=\"portalIntroPagePanorama\" class=\"img-responsive panorama\" src=\"https://jobs.msg.group/appo/public/images/applicationFormConfig/60ea89bb-bfa7-4fa6-8727-753ce9d051a1/INTRO_PAGE_PANORAMA/DCcEwCUD6UNrcoIjcHIdm7eI5jVBJPQx2RGUJD2GT1S.jpg\">\n    \n\n    <main class=\"container application-intro\" id=\"main\" role=\"main\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\" >\n            \n\n        <div id=\"intro-content\" class=\"\">\n            <div id=\"pageTitle\" class=\"page-header\">\n    \n    \n    <h1>Initiativbewerbung</h1>\n\n</div>\n\n\n            \n\n            <div id=\"headerIntroPage\"><p>Vielen Dank f&uuml;r dein Interesse an einer Mitarbeit in unserem Unternehmen. Wir freuen uns sehr auf deine Bewerbung!</p>\n\n<p>Um die Bewerbung f&uuml;r dich so einfach wie m&ouml;glich zu gestalten, bieten wir dir die Option, das Bewerbungsformular mit deinen Daten aus XING, LinkedIn oder deinem Lebenslauf vorauszuf&uuml;llen. Vorausgef&uuml;llte Eintr&auml;ge kannst du vor dem Versand der Bewerbung noch anpassen. Alternativ hast du die M&ouml;glichkeit, unser kurzes Bewerbugsformular auch manuell auszuf&uuml;llen.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Bitte nutze eine der folgenden M&ouml;glichkeiten:</p></div>\n\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                \n                    \n                        \n                        \n    <a href=\"/de/jobs/4/form\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-apply-with \" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <i class=\"fa fa-pencil fa-2x icon-bottom-padding\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><br />Bewerbungsformular<br>ausfüllen\n    </a>\n\n                    \n                    \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                    \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                            <div class=\"TK_WIDGET TK_WIDGET_hidden\" rel=\"cv\"></div>\n                            <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-apply-with\" href=\"#\" disabled=\"disabled\" id=\"applyWithCvAction\">\n                                <i class=\"fa fa-upload fa-2x icon-bottom-padding\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><br />Lebenslauf<br/>hochladen\n                            </a>\n                            <script nonce=\"on6YJGCsW2UHz/nViq6Paw==\" type=\"text/javascript\">\n                              document.getElementById(\"applyWithCvAction\").addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n                                e.preventDefault();\n                                $('input[name=uploaded_file]').click()\n                              })\n                            </script>\n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                    \n                        \n                        \n                            <div class=\"TK_WIDGET\" rel=\"xing\">\n                                \n                                \n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-apply-with btn-apply-with-xing\" rel=\"nofollow\" disabled=\"true\">\n        <i class=\"fab fa-xing fa-2x icon-bottom-padding\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><br />XING-Profil<br/>verwenden\n    </a>\n\n                            </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                    \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                            <div class=\"TK_WIDGET\" rel=\"linkedin\">\n                                \n                                \n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-apply-with btn-apply-with-linkedin\" rel=\"nofollow\" disabled=\"true\">\n        <i class=\"fab fa-linkedin fa-2x icon-bottom-padding\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><br />LinkedIn-Profil<br/>verwenden\n    </a>\n\n                            </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                    \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                    \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n            </div>\n\n            \n\n            <hr aria-hidden=\"true\" />\n\n            <div class=\"form-group buttons\">\n                \n\n    \n        \n    \n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</main> <!-- /container -->\n\n\n    <footer id=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            \n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                        <div id=\"portalFooter\"><section>\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://jobs.msg.group/appo/public/media/8a27234d-e33c-495b-b402-15ebc9251283/MS5gJRfTmrNfnCevK3nJPT1ncdnqkjK5rcZePNWrd74\" style=\"width: 168px; height: 53px;\" />\n<div class=\"socialmedia\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/msgsystems/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Facebook\"><i class=\"fab fa-facebook-f\"></i></a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/msg.karriere/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Instagram\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram\"></i></a> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/msggroup/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"LinkedIn\"><i class=\"fab fa-linkedin-in\"></i></a> <a href=\"https://www.xing.com/companies/msg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Xing\"><i class=\"fab fa-xing\"></i></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC63ztcsNouBMSUuc9Lk77UQ\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Youtube\"><i class=\"fab fa-youtube\"></i></a></div>\n<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.msg.group/de/datenschutz\" style=\"color: #131313;\" target=\"_blank\">Datenschutz</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.msg.group/de/impressum\" style=\"color: #131313;\" target=\"_blank\">Impressum</a></div>\n\n<p><strong>msg systems ag</strong><br />\nRobert-B&uuml;rkle-Stra&szlig;e 1<br />\n85737 Ismaning<br />\n<a href=\"mailto:recruiting@msg.group\">recruiting@msg.group</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.msg.group/de/karriere\" target=\"_blank\">www.msg.group/de/karriere</a></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://jobs.msg.group/appo/public/media/91d4f8a6-9709-44ac-8de7-113b701d5c76/Ec3TaQaQSjgTIrXkb0CX7EMBymx9ODeLF2ZBPZDVgWc\" style=\"width: 105px; height: 138px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://jobs.msg.group/appo/public/media/b68dc010-0ec7-4967-ae1b-252fc89ace39/sHmtQOEWRLrkfosHS2AbPLZC4YXVNHqeuLFHqJbGfx8\" style=\"width: 268px; height: 137px;\" /></p>\n</section></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            \n\n            <p id=\"portalPoweredBy\" class=\"pull-right small text-muted\">\n                powered by <a href=\"https://www.dvinci.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">d.vinci</a>\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        \n    </footer>\n\n    \n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/assets/application-0437b4b5b228b620ea7aa2e5915cc214.js\" ></script>\n    <script nonce=\"on6YJGCsW2UHz/nViq6Paw==\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/de/2026.23.0/i18n/bootstrap-datepicker.js\"></script>\n    <script nonce=\"on6YJGCsW2UHz/nViq6Paw==\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/de/2026.23.0/i18n/dvinci.js\"></script>\n    \n    \n        <script nonce=\"on6YJGCsW2UHz/nViq6Paw==\" type=\"text/javascript\">\n          dvinciMatomo.init({\n            matomoUrl: 'https://jobs.msg.group/analytics/',\n            settingsUrl: 'https://jobs.msg.group/settings'\n          })\n        </script>\n    \n    <script nonce=\"on6YJGCsW2UHz/nViq6Paw==\" type=\"text/javascript\">\n            $.getScript(\"https://home.textkernel.de/match//js/tkwidget.js\")\n                .done(function( script, textStatus ) {\n                    TK.re